  "prefLabel": "Mil 204.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mil 204.02 Scope. This part shall apply to all non-adjudicative hearings required by state law to be conducted by the board at which public comment shall be solicited.\n\nSource. #7529, eff 7-12-01",
